# The compacted serving database IS committed. It is the deployment artifact: 47 MB, one
# file, regenerated per release by scripts/build_deploy_db.py, and the thing that makes the
# repository deployable without a database server. The 164 MB full warehouse above is not.
!data/deploy/nledp-api.duckdb
data/deploy/*.wal

